<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Memoresse Brand Guide</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: #f8f7f6;
            color: #2d2b2c;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #b2c7b9;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .btn {
            background: #8d6e8d;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Memoresse Brand Guide</h1>
    
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Sacred Mission</h2>
        <p>To help families preserve memories and stories for generations, creating a private and secure family intelligence through effortless media sharing and engaging conversations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Brand Colors</h2>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
            <div style="background: #b2c7b9; width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 4px;"></div>
            <div>
                <strong>Sage Whisper</strong><br>
                #b2c7b9 - Primary
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0;">
            <div style="background: #8d6e8d; width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 4px;"></div>
            <div>
                <strong>Dusty Plum</strong><br>
                #8d6e8d - Secondary
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Assets Ready</h2>
        <p>✅ 21 brand assets organized</p>
        <p>✅ Logo collection (7 files)</p>
        <p>✅ Icons and textures</p>
        <p>✅ Color system</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Download Assets (Coming Soon)</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Development Status</h2>
        <p><strong>Server:</strong> Running at http://localhost:3000</p>
        <p><strong>Framework:</strong> Astro + Tailwind CSS</p>
        <p><strong>Assets:</strong> Organized and ready</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>